### **D. SECURITY SOFTWARE**

#### **✅ Authentication System**

**Multi-Layer Security:**
| Layer | Type | Implementation |
|-------|------|----------------|
| **Level 1** | PIN Login | 6-digit numeric PIN (Firebase validated) |
| **Level 2** | Admin Password | Token-based session |
| **Level 3** | Display Password | Hash-based token |
| **Level 4** | Camera Password | Token dengan force re-login |

**Password Storage Priority:**
1. Firebase: `karaoke/system/passwords/`
2. config.js (development only)
3. Default values (fallback)

